   "text": "id, hotelId, kind: individual | group\nparty { companyId?, contactId }   PII by id (D-20)\nsourceId?  (Setup BookingSource, lookup only)\narrive, depart  (depart exclusive)\nrequests[]: { roomTypeId, bedType, qty, adults,\n              children, ratePerNight }\nnotes?\nstatus: open | cancelled | closed\n\nrules: arrive < depart \u00b7 qty >= 1 \u00b7 cancel cascades to\nstays not checked in \u00b7 close only when all stays terminal\nand master folio 0 or transferred \u00b7 individual = 1 stay,\nroom assigned at creation",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "id, hotelId, kind: individual | group\nparty { companyId?, contactId }   PII by id (D-20)\nsourceId?  (Setup BookingSource, lookup only)\narrive, depart  (depart exclusive)\nrequests[]: { roomTypeId, bedType, qty, adults,\n              children, ratePerNight }\nnotes?\nstatus: open | cancelled | closed\n\nrules: arrive < depart \u00b7 qty >= 1 \u00b7 cancel cascades to\nstays not checked in \u00b7 close only when all stays terminal\nand master folio 0 or transferred \u00b7 individual = 1 stay,\nroom assigned at creation",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
