   "text": "per room: no two stays share (roomId, date)\nper type per night: booked <= rooms in service,\n  warn + explicit override\nevery command touching supply or demand versions\nthe stream in the same batch",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "per room: no two stays share (roomId, date)\nper type per night: booked <= rooms in service,\n  warn + explicit override\nevery command touching supply or demand versions\nthe stream in the same batch",
