   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1790171812717,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "id, hotelId, number, floor, roomTypeId, bedType\nhousekeeping: clean | dirty      (inspected -> later)\noutOfOrder? { reason, since }\nnote?\n\noccupied / vacant / arriving / departing are DERIVED\nfrom stays' nights, never stored\nrow is truth (tier b); OOO still versions availability",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "id, hotelId, number, floor, roomTypeId, bedType\nhousekeeping: clean | dirty      (inspected -> later)\noutOfOrder? { reason, since }\nnote?\n\noccupied / vacant / arriving / departing are DERIVED\nfrom stays' nights, never stored\nrow is truth (tier b); OOO still versions availability",
