   "text": "needs   -\nchecks  Billing and Expenses post entries; Ledger\n        enforces sum(lines) = 0, immutability, close\n        at 0\nemits   ledger.account_opened \u00b7 entry_posted \u00b7\n        entry_reversed \u00b7 account_closed",
   "fontSize": 10.5,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "needs   -\nchecks  Billing and Expenses post entries; Ledger\n        enforces sum(lines) = 0, immutability, close\n        at 0\nemits   ledger.account_opened \u00b7 entry_posted \u00b7\n        entry_reversed \u00b7 account_closed",
