   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1790171812717,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Front Desk   receptionist \u00b7 owner\n  room map \u00b7 tape chart \u00b7 new booking \u00b7 booking page \u00b7 stay page\n  folio (print) \u00b7 arrivals / departures \u00b7 search\n\nBack Office  owner \u00b7 receptionist (receivables, expenses - assumed)\n  dashboard \u00b7 receivables \u00b7 expenses \u00b7 reports (owner)\n\nSetup        owner\n  CRUD per Setup item \u00b7 users + roles\n\nroles v1: receptionist, owner (fixed capability bundles; custom later)\nowner-only by default: void \u00b7 refund \u00b7 write-off \u00b7 transfer \u00b7 reports \u00b7 setup \u00b7 users",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Front Desk   receptionist \u00b7 owner\n  room map \u00b7 tape chart \u00b7 new booking \u00b7 booking page \u00b7 stay page\n  folio (print) \u00b7 arrivals / departures \u00b7 search\n\nBack Office  owner \u00b7 receptionist (receivables, expenses - assumed)\n  dashboard \u00b7 receivables \u00b7 expenses \u00b7 reports (owner)\n\nSetup        owner\n  CRUD per Setup item \u00b7 users + roles\n\nroles v1: receptionist, owner (fixed capability bundles; custom later)\nowner-only by default: void \u00b7 refund \u00b7 write-off \u00b7 transfer \u00b7 reports \u00b7 setup \u00b7 users",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
